  "presentation_summary": [
    "Four days of dry cough, fatigue, weakness, fever, and dyspnea in a patient with seronegative rheumatoid arthritis on abatacept, methotrexate, and prior biologic therapy.",
    "Admission exam showed poor general status, respiratory distress, tachycardia, fever, and no active articular inflammation.",
    "Labs showed WBC 7.79 x10^9/L, neutrophils 5.83 x10^9/L, lymphocytes 1.14 x10^9/L, LDH 417 U/L, CRP 11.20 mg/dL, and ESR 89 mm/h.",
    "Chest imaging showed diffuse reticular interstitial infiltrates and CT ground-glass interstitial pattern; severe pulmonary involvement required ICU and noninvasive ventilatory support."
